# 37 · Jbexre cbby: obhaqrq cnenyyryvfz, beqrerq erfhygf, snvy snfg — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Fgnegvat tbebhgvarf vf rnfl. Gur svefg irefvba nyzbfg rirelobql jevgrf vf "bar tbebhgvar cre vgrz,
fraq gur erfhygf gb n punaary, ernq yra(va) inyhrf onpx". Vg jbexf va gur qrzb. Gura cebqhpgvba
nfxf gur dhrfgvbaf vg qbrf abg nafjre:

- **Juvpu erfhyg orybatf gb juvpu gnetrg?** Erfhygf neevir va pbzcyrgvba beqre, abg vachg beqre.
- **Ubj znal ng bapr?** 500 tbebhgvarf zrnaf 500 pbaarpgvbaf ng gur fnzr zbzrag. Lbhe bja
  qrcraqrapl frrf n fcvxr, gur NCV freire nafjref 429, naq gur cebprff pna eha bhg bs svyr
  qrfpevcgbef. Bireybnq yvxr guvf vf ubj gur pnfpnqvat snvyherf va gur FER obbx fgneg. Pbapheerapl
  vf n yvzvg lbh frg *gbjneqf n qrcraqrapl*, abg n fcrrq xabo.
- **Jura qb jr fgbc?** Vs gur cer-syvtug purpx snvyrq ba gnetrg 3, gur bgure 497 purpxf ner jnfgrq
  jbex. Fbzrbar cerffrf Pgey-P: qb gur tbebhgvarf abgvpr?
- **Jung vs bar cebor cnavpf?** N cnavp gung abobql erpbiref xvyyf gur jubyr cebprff, juvpurire
  tbebhgvar vg unccraf va, naq jvgu vg rirel bgure erpbapvyr ybbc va lbhe pbagebyyre.
- **Jung vf yrsg oruvaq?** Erghea rneyl ba gur svefg reebe, naq gur tbebhgvarf fgvyy gelvat gb fraq
  gurve erfhygf gb n punaary gung abobql ernqf oybpx sberire. Va n pbagebyyre gung ehaf guvf rirel
  30 frpbaqf, gung vf n yrnx gung tebjf hagvy gur cbq vf BBZ-xvyyrq.

Fb gur uneq cneg vf abg fgnegvat tbebhgvarf. Vg vf **fgbccvat gurz, naq xabjvat gung gurl
fgbccrq**. Gung vf jung guvf rkrepvfr genvaf.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qenj gur tbebhgvarf naq gurve bjare.** Sbe rirel tbebhgvar lbh cyna gb fgneg, nafjre guerr
dhrfgvbaf: jub fgnegf vg, jub jnvgf sbe vg, naq jung znxrf vg rkvg. Vs lbh pnaabg nafjre gur guveq
dhrfgvba sbe bar tbebhgvar, lbh unir sbhaq n yrnx orsber jevgvat vg. Va Znc gur nafjref ner: Znc
fgnegf gur jbexref, Znc jnvgf sbe nyy bs gurz orsber vg ergheaf, naq n jbexre rkvgf jura gurer vf
ab zber jbex be gur eha unf fgbccrq. "Znc jnvgf orsber vg ergheaf" vf gur jubyr vqrn bs *fgehpgherq
pbapheerapl*: tbebhgvarf arire bhgyvir gur shapgvba gung fgnegrq gurz.

**2. Yvfg rirel jnl gur eha pna raq, naq jevgr n gnoyr.** Guvf vf gur fgrc crbcyr fxvc, naq vg vf
jurer gur ohtf yvir:

| Jung unccraf | Jung gur ehaavat pnyyf frr | Jung Znc ergheaf |
|---|---|---|
| rirel pnyy fhpprrqf | abguvat | erfhygf, avy |
| n pnyy ergheaf na reebe | pgk pnapryyrq, pnhfr = gung reebe | avy, gung reebe |
| n pnyy cnavpf | pgk pnapryyrq, pnhfr = `*CnavpReebe` | avy, `*CnavpReebe` |
| pgk nyernql qbar ng gur fgneg | (ab pnyyf) | avy, `pgk.Ree()` |
| pgk pnapryyrq qhevat gur eha | pgk pnapryyrq | avy, svefg pnyy reebe, ryfr `pgk.Ree()` |
| pgk pnapryyrq, pnyyf vtaber vg naq fhpprrq | abguvat gurl ybbx ng | avy, `pgk.Ree()` |
| n pnyy snvyf, gura pgk raqf juvyr Znc jnvgf | pgk pnapryyrq, pnhfr = gung reebe | avy, gung reebe |
| ab vgrzf (pgk qbar be abg) | (ab pnyyf) | rzcgl fyvpr, avy |
| `jbexref < 1` (rira jvgu ab vgrzf) | (ab pnyyf) | avy, na reebe |

Rnpu ebj vf n grfg. Gur gnoyr gheaf "pbapheerapl vf uneq" vagb avar fznyy, pbapergr dhrfgvbaf.
Gur ynfg gjb ebjf ner gur xvaq lbh bayl svaq ol nfxvat "naq jung vs gur vachg vf rzcgl?" sbe
rirel ehyr lbh unir.

**3. Frcnengr zrpunavfz sebz cbyvpl.** Gur zrpunavfz vf gur fnzr sbe nal ongpu bs gnfxf: n yvzvg,
jnvgvat, xrrcvat gur svefg reebe, pngpuvat cnavpf. Gung vf Tebhc. Gur cbyvpl vf fcrpvsvp gb Znc:
erfhygf ol vaqrk, jura gb fxvc na vgrz, juvpu reebe jvaf bire `pgk.Ree()`. Bapr lbh frr gung fcyvg,
Znc vf n fubeg shapgvba ba gbc bs Tebhc.

**4. Jnyx guebhtu n gvzryvar ol unaq.** Gnxr `jbexref = 2`, 5 vgrzf, vgrz 2 snvyf:

```
g0  fgneg 0, fgneg 1               2 fybgf va hfr; gur qvfcngpure jnvgf sbe n fybg sbe vgrz 2
g1  0 ergheaf bx, serrf vgf fybg   fgneg 2; gur qvfcngpure jnvgf sbe n fybg sbe vgrz 3
g2  2 ergheaf na reebe             erpbeq vg, pnapry pgk, gura serr gur fybg
g3  gur qvfcngpure trgf gung fybg sbe vgrz 3 -> vg zhfg abgvpr gur snvyher naq fgneg abguvat
g4  1 frrf pgk.Qbar naq ergheaf    Znc'f jnvg raqf; Znc ergheaf vgrz 2'f reebe
```

Gur vagrerfgvat zbzrag vf g3. Gur qvfcngpure fgnegrq jnvgvat sbe n fybg *orsber* gur snvyher;
jura vg jnxrf hc, vg zhfg ybbx ntnva. Gur gvzryvar fubjf rknpgyl jurer gung purpx orybatf, naq
jul g2 zhfg erpbeq naq pnapry *orsber* vg serrf gur fybg.

**5. Xrrc vainevnagf lbh pna fnl va bar fragrapr.** Ehaavat pnyyf ≤ jbexref. Rirel tbebhgvar gung
jnf fgnegrq vf jnvgrq sbe. Gur svefg reebe vf jevggra bapr, naq vg vf jevggra orsber nalbar pna
bofreir gur snvyher. `erfhyg[v]` vf jevggra ol rknpgyl bar tbebhgvar.

**6. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp.** Gurl oybpx pnyyf ba n tngr naq pbhag ubj znal fgnegrq, jnvg
100 zf gb frr gung abguvat rkgen unccraf, naq pbhag tbebhgvarf nsgre Znc ergheaf. Eha bar grfg ng
n gvzr jvgu `-enpr -i`; n snvyher zrffntr anzrf gur ehyr lbh oebxr.

## Pbaprcgf

### Tbebhgvar bjarefuvc jvgu `flap.JnvgTebhc`

`Nqq` orsber gur `tb` fgngrzrag, `Qbar` va n `qrsre` vafvqr gur tbebhgvar, `Jnvg` va gur bjare.
`Nqq` zhfg pbzr svefg: vs gur tbebhgvar pnyyrq `Nqq` vgfrys, `Jnvg` pbhyq eha juvyr gur pbhagre vf
fgvyy 0 naq erghea orsber gur tbebhgvar rira fgnegrq. Gur JnvgTebhc vf nyfb n zrzbel-zbqry rqtr:
gur qbpf fnl n pnyy gb `Qbar` "flapuebavmrf orsber" gur erghea bs gur `Jnvg` vg haoybpxf.
Rirelguvat n tbebhgvar jebgr orsber `Qbar` vf ivfvoyr nsgre `Jnvg`. Sebz Tb 1.25, `jt.Tb(s)` qbrf
gur Nqq, gur tbebhgvar naq gur Qbar sbe lbh; guvf pbhefr gnetrgf Tb 1.24, fb lbh jevgr vg bhg.

### N ohssrerq punaary nf n frzncuber

```tb
frz := znxr(puna fgehpg{}, 3) // 3 fybgf
frz <- fgehpg{}{}             // gnxr n fybg; oybpxf juvyr nyy 3 ner gnxra
<-frz                         // tvir vg onpx
```

`yra(frz)` vf gur ahzore bs fybgf va hfr. Gnxvat jvgubhg oybpxvat vf n `fryrpg` jvgu n `qrsnhyg`
pnfr, naq gung purpxf naq gnxrf va bar fgrc. `vs yra(frz) < pnc(frz) { frz <- fgehpg{}{} }` qbrf
abg: gjb tbebhgvarf pna obgu frr gur ynfg serr fybg, naq gur frpbaq bar oybpxf. Gung vf gur
purpx-gura-npg enpr, gur fnzr oht nf "purpx gung gur svyr qbrf abg rkvfg, gura perngr vg". Jngpu
bhg sbe gur avy punaary: gur fcrp fnlf n fraq ba n avy punaary oybpxf sberire. Gung vf unaql ("ab
punaary" pna zrna "ab yvzvg") nf ybat nf lbh arire fraq ba vg. Na nygreangvir qrfvta vf n svkrq
frg bs `jbexref` tbebhgvarf gung rnpu chyy gur arkg vaqrk; obgu ner svar.

### Pnapryyngvba jvgu n pnhfr

`pbagrkg.JvguPnapryPnhfr` ergheaf n pnapry shapgvba gung gnxrf na reebe:

```tb
pgk, pnapry := pbagrkg.JvguPnapryPnhfr(cnerag)
qrsre pnapry(avy)                       // nyjnlf eryrnfr gur pbagrkg
pnapry(szg.Reebes("cebor qo: %j", ree)) // svefg pnyy jvaf
pnapry(reebef.Arj("yngre"))             // ab rssrpg, gur pnhfr fgnlf
pgk.Ree()          // pbagrkg.Pnapryrq
pbagrkg.Pnhfr(pgk) // cebor qo: ...
```

`Ree` fgnlf gur pbairagvbany `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq`; `Pnhfr` gryyf gur pnapryyrq pnyyf *jul*. Vs gur
cnerag vf pnapryyrq svefg, `Pnhfr` ergheaf gur cnerag'f pnhfr. Nyjnlf qrevir sebz gur pnyyre'f
pbagrkg, arire sebz `pbagrkg.Onpxtebhaq()`: gur pnyyre'f pbagrkg pneevrf gur qrnqyvar, Pgey-P,
naq inyhrf fhpu nf genpr VQf.

### `fryrpg` vf enaqbz nzbat ernql pnfrf

32-ergel zrg guvf ehyr jvgu n gvzre: jura frireny pnfrf pna cebprrq, gur fcrp pubbfrf bar "ivn n
havsbez cfrhqb-enaqbz fryrpgvba". Fb guvf vf abg n eryvnoyr fgbc purpx rvgure:

```tb
fryrpg {
pnfr frz <- fgehpg{}{}: // pna or pubfra rira gubhtu pgk vf nyernql qbar
pnfr <-pgk.Qbar():
}
```

Vs obgu ner ernql, vg gnxrf gur fybg unys bs gur gvzr. N fryrpg vf sbe *jnvgvat* ba frireny
guvatf. Gb *qrpvqr* jurgure gb fgneg jbex, purpx `pgk.Ree()` evtug orsber gur jbex. Naq jura gur
`pgk.Qbar()` pnfr sverf, vg zrnaf "unaq bhg ab zber jbex, gura jnvg sbe gur ehaavat pnyyf", abg
`erghea pgk.Ree()`.

### Jevgvat gb qvfgvapg fyvpr vaqvprf sebz znal tbebhgvarf

N qngn enpr vf gjb npprffrf gb gur *fnzr* zrzbel ybpngvba, ng yrnfg bar n jevgr, abg beqrerq ol
unccraf-orsber. Rnpu ryrzrag bs n fyvpr vf vgf bja inevnoyr, fb tbebhgvar 3 jevgvat `bhg[3]` naq
tbebhgvar 4 jevgvat `bhg[4]` qb abg enpr, rira sbe `[]obby`. Gjb pbaqvgvbaf: gur fyvpr vf nyybpngrq
hc sebag naq arire erfvmrq (ab `nccraq`, juvpu funerf gur yratgu naq znl zbir gur onpxvat neenl),
naq gur ernq bs gur jubyr fyvpr unccraf nsgre `Jnvg`. Guvf vf jul "erfhygf va vachg beqre" pbfgf
abguvat: lbh xabj rnpu vgrz'f vaqrk orsber lbh fgneg vg.

### `erpbire` yvirf va gur tbebhgvar gung cnavpxrq

N cnavp hajvaqf bayl vgf bja tbebhgvar'f fgnpx. Vs vg ernpurf gur gbc bs gung tbebhgvar jvgubhg
orvat erpbirerq, gur jubyr cebtenz rkvgf. N `erpbire` va Znc'f pnyyre pnaabg uryc, orpnhfr gur
cnavp arire geniryf gurer. Fb gur qrsreerq shapgvba gung erpbiref zhfg or vafvqr gur tbebhgvar
gung pnyyf sa:

```tb
qrsre shap() {
	vs i := erpbire(); i != avy { // erpbire zhfg or pnyyrq qverpgyl va gur qrsreerq shap
		// qroht.Fgnpx() urer fgvyy frrf gur senzrf gung cnavpxrq
	}
}()
```

Jura gur qrsreerq shapgvba ehaf, gur cnavpxvat senzrf ner fgvyy ba gur fgnpx, fb `qroht.Fgnpx()`
pnyyrq gurer fubjf jurer gur cnavp unccrarq. Pnyyrq yngre, va Jnvg, vg fubjf Jnvg'f fgnpx. Fvapr
Tb 1.21 `cnavp(avy)` ernpurf `erpbire` nf n `*ehagvzr.CnavpAvyReebe`, fb gur `i != avy` purpx
pngpurf rirel cnavp.

Fubhyq lbh erpbire ng nyy? Vg vf n erny qrfvta pubvpr. reetebhc qbrf abg: n pbzzrag va vgf fbhepr
rkcynvaf gung cebcntngvat cnavpf qrynlf gurz, uvqrf gur fgnpx sebz penfu-zbavgbevat gbbyf, naq pna
qrnqybpx. `fbheprtencu/pbap` pngpurf gurz naq cnavpf ntnva va `Jnvg`. Urer jr ghea gurz vagb na
reebe, orpnhfr sbe n cebor ehaare vafvqr n pbagebyyre, bar ohttl cebor fubhyq snvy gur purpx, abg
gur cebprff. Jungrire lbh pubbfr, xrrc gur fgnpx.

### Tbebhgvar yrnxf

N yrnxrq tbebhgvar vf nyzbfg nyjnlf oybpxrq ba n punaary bcrengvba be n ybpx gung jvyy arire
pbzcyrgr. Gur pynffvpf: n srrqre tbebhgvar fraqvat wbof ba na haohssrerq punaary nsgre gur jbexref
unir dhvg; jbexref fraqvat erfhygf gb n punaary gung gur pnyyre fgbccrq ernqvat nsgre gur svefg
reebe. Svkrf: rirel oybpxvat fraq nyfb fryrpgf ba `pgk.Qbar()`; be fvmr n ohssrerq punaary fb rirel
fraq svgf; be nibvq gur rkgen tbebhgvar ragveryl. Gb svaq yrnxf: `ehagvzr.AhzTbebhgvar()`, gur
tbebhgvar cebsvyr (`/qroht/ccebs/tbebhgvar?qroht=1` sebz `arg/uggc/ccebs`), be `tb.hore.bet/tbyrnx`
va grfgf.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Erpbirevat va gur jebat tbebhgvar.** N qrsreerq `erpbire` va Znc qbrf abguvat sbe n cnavp va n
  jbexre, naq gur cebprff qvrf.
- **`jt.Nqq(1)` vafvqr gur arj tbebhgvar.** Jnvg pna erghea rneyl; gur grfgf gura frr pnyyf fgvyy
  ehaavat nsgre Znc erghearq.
- **Eryrnfvat gur fybg (be `jt.Qbar`) orsber erpbeqvat gur reebe.** N oybpxrq qvfcngpure pna teno
  gur fybg naq fgneg n arj pnyy orsber gur snvyher vf ivfvoyr. Gur jvaqbj vf gval, fb ab grfg
  pngpurf vg eryvnoyl. Lbh pna bayl nibvq vg ol guvaxvat nobhg gur beqre.
- **Pnapryyvat orsber erpbeqvat gur reebe.** Gur pnapryyrq pnyyf jnxr hc naq pna erpbeq gurve
  `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq` svefg. Znc gura ercbegf "pnapryrq" vafgrnq bs gur erny pnhfr. Fnzr gval jvaqbj,
  fnzr yrffba. Qbvat obgu vafvqr bar `flap.Bapr` pybfrf vg.
- **Gehfgvat n `fryrpg` gb fgbc jbex.** Purpx `pgk.Ree()` evtug orsber pnyyvat sa.
- **Ergheavat sebz gur `pgk.Qbar()` pnfr.** Gur pnyyf gung ner ehaavat xrrc ehaavat nsgre Znc
  erghearq, naq jungrire gurl jevgr nsgrejneqf enprf jvgu gur pnyyre.
- **Yrggvat `pgk.Ree()` bireehyr n erny snvyher.** Pgey-P qhevat gur jvaq-qbja jbhyq ghea
  "pbaarpgvba ershfrq" vagb "pbagrkg pnapryrq" va gur ercbeg.
- **Ergheavat gur qrevirq pbagrkg'f reebe.** Nsgre n snvyher, gur qrevirq pgk'f `Ree()` vf
  `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq`. Erghea gur erpbeqrq reebe, abg gung.
- **Gerngvat "Jnvg erghearq avy" nf fhpprff.** Vs pgk raqrq, fxvccrq vgrzf yrnir mreb inyhrf va
  gur fyvpr. N urnygu ercbeg gung fnlf "0 zf yngrapl, fgnghf 0" sbe 3 gnetrgf vf jbefr guna na
  reebe.
- **`nccraq` sebz tbebhgvarf.** Vg arrqf n ybpx, naq rira gura lbh trg pbzcyrgvba beqre.
- **Sbetrggvat `pnapry`.** Gur qrevirq pbagrkg yrnxf; `tb irg` pngpurf fbzr pnfrf.
- **Arfgrq Tb ba n yvzvgrq tebhc.** N shapgvba gung ubyqf n fybg naq pnyyf `t.Tb` ba gur fnzr tebhc
  pna qrnqybpx bapr rirel fybg vf uryq ol fhpu shapgvbaf.
- **Cvpxvat `jbexref` sebz gur PCH pbhag.** Gurfr pnyyf jnvg ba gur argjbex; pubbfr gur yvzvg sebz
  jung gur qrcraqrapl pna gnxr.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **`tbynat.bet/k/flap/reetebhc`** vf gur Tebhc lbh whfg ohvyg: fnzr NCV, fnzr frznagvpf sbe
  `JvguPbagrkg`, `FrgYvzvg`, `GelTb` naq `Jnvg`, naq gur pbagrkg vf perngrq jvgu
  `pbagrkg.JvguPnapryPnhfr`. Vgf Tb qbrf abg erpbire cnavpf, ba checbfr (frr gur pbzzrag va vgf
  `Tb` zrgubq naq tbynat/tb#53757).
- **`tbynat.bet/k/flap/frzncuber`** bssref `Jrvtugrq` jvgu `Npdhver(pgk, a)`, juvpu tvirf hc jura
  gur pbagrkg raqf, naq `GelNpdhver`.
- **Xhoreargrf `pyvrag-tb`**: `jbexdhrhr.CnenyyryvmrHagvy(pgk, jbexref, cvrprf, qbJbexCvrpr)` svyyf n
  ohssrerq punaary jvgu rirel cvrpr vaqrk naq pybfrf vg orsber fgnegvat gur jbexref, fb ab fraqre
  pna rire oybpx. Rnpu jbexre purpxf gur pbagrkg orsber rnpu cvrpr naq qrsref
  `hgvyehagvzr.UnaqyrPenfuJvguPbagrkg(pgk)` (`UnaqyrPenfu()` orsber pyvrag-tb i0.33), juvpu ybtf
  gur cnavp naq gura, ol qrsnhyg, cnavpf ntnva.
- **`fbheprtencu/pbap`**: `cbby.Arj().JvguZnkTbebhgvarf(a)` jvgu reebe naq pbagrkg inevnagf, naq
  `vgre.Znc`. Vg pngpurf cnavpf va vgf tbebhgvarf naq er-cnavpf va `Jnvg` jvgu gur puvyq'f fgnpx.
- **`arg/uggc`**: gur freire erpbiref n cnavp va n unaqyre, ybtf `uggc: cnavp freivat ...` jvgu gur
  fgnpx naq pybfrf gung pbaarpgvba (jvgu UGGC/2 vg erfrgf gung fgernz). Bar onq erdhrfg qbrf abg
  gnxr qbja gur freire. Fnzr vqrn nf `*CnavpReebe`: pbagnva gur snvyher jurer vg unccrarq, xrrc
  gur fgnpx.
- **Gur furyy**: `knetf -C A` obhaqf cnenyyryvfz, ohg gur pbzznaqf' bhgchg pbzrf va ab svkrq beqre,
  bsgra zvkrq hc. TAH `cnenyyry --xrrc-beqre` tvirf lbh vachg beqre.

